# Connector: Dado que
<!-- id: c1_connector_dado_que | level: C1 | topic: connectors | type: cloze -->

> **Grammar Rule**: 'Dado que' (given that / since) is a causal connector and is followed by the indicative.

### Context
English: "Given that it is raining, we won't go out."

### Exercise
Dado que (llover) ___ , no saldremos.

<!-- SOLUTION
llueve
-->

<!-- ALTERNATIVES
está lloviendo
-->

